  <h2>Promoting Mounted Games Across the U.S. Since 1986.</h2>
  <p>Founded in 1986, the United States Mounted Games Association has helped grow and promote Mounted Games across the country for nearly 40 years. USMGA supports safe, fair, and accessible competition while encouraging rider development, sportsmanship, and a strong community for riders, teams, volunteers, and supporters.</p>

  <h2>What Are Mounted Games?</h2>
  <p>Mounted Games is a fast-paced equestrian sport featuring relay-style races that test speed, skill, teamwork, and horsemanship. Riders compete in a variety of exciting games that require precision, athleticism, and a strong partnership between horse and rider.</p>
  <p>As part of the International Mounted Games Association, USMGA connects riders in the U.S. to a broader global community while promoting the values of safety, fairness, education, accessibility, and sportsmanship.</p>
